+# 2025-26 historical materials (authority: HISTORICAL_ONLY)
+
+- `25-26-WGHIC-Approved-ETF-List.pdf` (+ `.txt` extraction): last season's approved ETF list (100 ETFs), provided by Team Leader Ray on 2026-09-27.
+
+This is NOT the 2026-27 approved list. Use it only to anticipate likely instruments; every ticker must be checked against the current WInS approved list before trading. Notable: Treasury funds IEF, TLT, GOVT, SHY, SHV, BIL, VGSH, USFR; TIPS funds TIP, VTIP; no defined-maturity (iBonds) or STRIPS/zero-coupon Treasury ETFs.
